								<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
								<string name="Text">A Missile Silo lets you launch Atom bombs, Hydrogen bombs and MIRVs. Blasts wipe out troops and structures and leave fallout: land that stays poisoned until someone re-conquers it, slowly and at a high cost. Nuking an ally&apos;s land breaks the alliance. SAM Launchers shoot down bombs aimed inside their range (70 tiles); a MIRV can&apos;t be stopped, but SAMs can pick off its warheads.</string>
