								<string name="Text"><![CDATA[<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Click</b></font>   Expand, attack or send a boat
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Right-click</b></font>   Action menu
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Drag</b></font>   Pan the map
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>WASD / Arrows</b></font>   Pan the map
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Wheel / Q E</b></font>   Zoom
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>1 – 6</b></font>   Build
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>T / Y</b></font>   Attack share −/+ 10%
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>G / B</b></font>   Attack / send a boat at the cursor
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>K / L</b></font>   Propose / break an alliance
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>C</b></font>   Go to your land
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Esc</b></font>   Cancel
<font color="#FFFFFF"><b>Click a warship</b></font>   Then click the sea to move it]]></string>
